    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d474">

                <pb facs="0439" n="365" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg365"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Clay</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 110.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-12-19"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 19, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I enclose herewith, for your information
                    and guidance, a copy of an order issued by this department on the 17th instant,
                    directing that, with the exception of immigrant passengers, no traveller shall
                    be allowed to enter the United States without a passport signed and vised by an
                    American minister or consul. You will make this fact known to the Russian
                    government.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cassius M. Clay,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d474-a1.xml" xpointer="d474-a1"/>
            </div>
